mapping "V1151.1" source="V1151" target="215125004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V1151 (Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 V11.5) = SNOMED CT 215125004. The activity suffix
        (idrott/sport/motion) is a Swedish national extension with no SNOMED CT analogue. Target SNOMED CT
        4062888 (code 215125004) =, an active standard Event concept. The precise SNOMED CT equivalent
        219489009 is deprecated (invalid_reason D, valid_end 2009-01-31) and no longer standard. 4062888
        is the closest active standard target: it captures the pedal-cycle-vs-pedal-cycle collision
        dimension but drops the passenger-role, traffic-context, and activity dimensions. Low tier :
        real overlap on accident type, meaningful specificity loss on three dimensions. broader because
        the target fully contains the source's collision semantics at a coarser level.
        """
}
